WEBVTT - observer: who watches the narrative of the 8 agents

NOTE
The 8th point of the canon's Fano plane: "The 8th belongs to the session."
(canon-manifest.ndjson, metadata protocol). One cue per observer, one second long,
in the order registered; the time is the order. The identifier is the observer;
the voice is the agent tag it observes through. Never delete a cue: a later cue
replaces it. The series files beside this one are written by zvtt in Plan 9
(unbound/PLAN9/src/zvtt.c, vtt.rc) from light-garden's canon; each cue's
identifier is its canon file and line, the same line boxedPINE's
public/narrative/timeline.ndjson names as node_id "canon:FILE#LN".

